    narr:narration """This hub gathers the calibration-and-verification record for the Kestrelwood spectrograph, dated 20260718. QuillAshgrove opens with a direct instrument report — [88.4 MHz calibration announcement](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ForgetLifecycleTargetReturn_1) — then extends it with [cross-verification against June reference plates across the full observing band](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ForgetLifecycleTargetReturn_2), grounding the number in a prior standard. XenaExpertgh then enters as envelope composer, contributing [an editorial decision-summary header](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ForgetLifecycleTargetReturn_3) followed by two composed-but-not-endorsed bullets: [instrument identification](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ForgetLifecycleTargetReturn_4) and [calibration value with reference](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ForgetLifecycleTargetReturn_5). The thematic span is narrow: instrument identity, a specific frequency, and a verification method. Nothing here addresses scheduling, observing targets, data reduction, or instrument alternatives.""" ;
